20

17. Critical Rule in Postfix

Suppose stack has:

[3]
[5]

and operator is -.

You must calculate:

5 - 3

NOT:

3 - 5

Because the first popped element is the right operand.

For an operator:

a op b

the process is:

b = first pop
a = second pop

a op b

